</section>

<!-- INTELLIGENCE FEED -->
<section class="feed" id="feed">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="feed-head">
      <div>
        <span class="section-eyebrow">The feed</span>
        <h2 class="section-title">Intelligence, in order of arrival.</h2>
      </div>
      <span class="feed-meta">Weekly · Curated · Linked at source</span>
    </div>

    <div class="feed-grid">
      <ol class="article-list" id="articleList">

        <li data-cat="alert" id="voice-cloning-global">
          <span class="article-num"></span>
          <div>
            <div class="article-card-meta">
              <span class="tag tag-alert">Alerte</span>
              <span class="article-date">May 10, 2026</span>
            </div>
            <h3><a href="https://news.trendmicro.com/2026/04/16/ai-voice-cloning/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Les arnaques au clonage vocal IA s'accélèrent à l'échelle mondiale</a></h3>
            <p>AI-generated voice impersonation scams are rapidly becoming more sophisticated, allowing attackers to mimic family members, bank employees and public officials with alarming realism — and at a pace defenders can no longer match by ear.</p>
            <a class="article-source" href="https://news.trendmicro.com/2026/04/16/ai-voice-cloning/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source · <strong>Trend Micro</strong></a>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li data-cat="regulation" id="uk-reimbursement">
          <span class="article-num"></span>
          <div>
            <div class="article-card-meta">
              <span class="tag tag-regulation">Réglementation</span>
              <span class="article-date">May 8, 2026</span>
            </div>
            <h3><a href="https://www.threatmark.com/six-months-of-psr-scam-reimbursement/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Les règles britanniques de remboursement des arnaques remodèlent la prévention de la fraude</a></h3>
            <p>New UK reimbursement regulations are increasing pressure on financial institutions to prevent scams before losses occur. The focus is shifting away from post-fraud reimbursement and toward proactive, real-time intervention at the moment of decision.</p>
            <a class="article-source" href="https://www.threatmark.com/six-months-of-psr-scam-reimbursement/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source · <strong>ThreatMark</strong></a>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li data-cat="research" id="experts-ai-voices">
          <span class="article-num"></span>
          <div>
            <div class="article-card-meta">
              <span class="tag tag-research">Recherche</span>
              <span class="article-date">May 6, 2026</span>
            </div>
            <h3><a href="https://www.vectra.ai/topics/ai-scams" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Même les experts peinent à détecter les voix générées par IA</a></h3>
            <p>A recent peer-reviewed study found that participants — including those highly confident in their abilities — often failed to distinguish real human speech from AI-generated voice clones. Human intuition alone is becoming insufficient.</p>
            <a class="article-source" href="https://www.vectra.ai/topics/ai-scams" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source · <strong>Vectra AI Research</strong></a>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li data-cat="regulation" id="gasa-policy-2026">
          <span class="article-num"></span>
          <div>
            <div class="article-card-meta">
              <span class="tag tag-policy">Politique</span>
              <span class="article-date">May 5, 2026</span>
            </div>
            <h3><a href="https://www.gasa.org/post/global-state-of-scams-report-2024-1-trillion-stolen-in-12-months-gasa-feedzai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GASA appelle à une coordination mondiale renforcée contre les arnaques</a></h3>
            <p>The Global Anti-Scam Alliance's standing policy agenda continues to emphasise consumer education, intelligence sharing, cross-sector collaboration and coordinated anti-scam initiatives across borders — themes that have only intensified through 2025–2026.</p>
            <a class="article-source" href="https://www.gasa.org/post/global-state-of-scams-report-2024-1-trillion-stolen-in-12-months-gasa-feedzai" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source · <strong>GASA</strong></a>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li data-cat="alert" id="ai-scams-industrialised">
          <span class="article-num"></span>
          <div>
            <div class="article-card-meta">
              <span class="tag tag-alert">Alerte</span>
              <span class="article-date">May 3, 2026</span>
            </div>
            <h3><a href="https://www.cnbc.com/2026/05/09/ai-powered-scam-calls-getting-more-convincing.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Les menaces d'arnaque par IA s'industrialisent à grande échelle</a></h3>
            <p>Industry researchers warn that AI-powered scams are becoming scalable, automated and globally distributed, dramatically increasing the speed and volume of attacks against consumers — and shortening the window in which a person can react.</p>
            <a class="article-source" href="https://www.cnbc.com/2026/05/09/ai-powered-scam-calls-getting-more-convincing.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source · <strong>CNBC</strong></a>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li data-cat="regulation" id="govt-ai-regulation">
          <span class="article-num"></span>
          <div>
            <div class="article-card-meta">
              <span class="tag tag-regulation">Réglementation</span>
              <span class="article-date">April 28, 2026</span>
            </div>
            <h3><a href="https://www.americanbar.org/groups/senior_lawyers/resources/voice-of-experience/2025-september/ai-cloned-voice-scam/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Les gouvernements intensifient leur attention sur la sécurité de l'IA et la réglementation de la fraude</a></h3>
            <p>Governments and regulators worldwide are beginning to introduce frameworks focused on AI-generated deception, impersonation and consumer fraud protection. Responsible AI is becoming a regulatory priority — not a discussion topic.</p>
            <a class="article-source" href="https://www.americanbar.org/groups/senior_lawyers/resources/voice-of-experience/2025-september/ai-cloned-voice-scam/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source · <strong>American Bar Association</strong></a>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li data-cat="guide" id="guide-voice-cloning">
          <span class="article-num"></span>
          <div>
            <div class="article-card-meta">
              <span class="tag tag-guide">Guide</span>
              <span class="article-date">April 25, 2026</span>
            </div>
            <h3><a href="../knowledge.html">How to protect yourself from voice-cloning scams</a></h3>
            <p>A practical, field-tested guide to recognising and defending against AI voice impersonation attacks. Warning signs, verification phrases families can agree on, and the call-back habits that turn a panicked moment back into a thinking one.</p>
            <a class="article-source" href="../knowledge.html">Source · <strong>ASPS</strong></a>
          </div>
        </li>

        <li data-cat="news" id="bank-impersonation-eu">
          <span class="article-num"></span>
          <div>
            <div class="article-card-meta">
              <span class="tag tag-news">Actualités</span>
              <span class="article-date">April 20, 2026</span>
            </div>
            <h3><a href="https://sqmagazine.co.uk/ai-voice-cloning-fraud-statistics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Les arnaques d'usurpation bancaire explosent sur les marchés européens</a></h3>
            <p>Financial institutions across Europe report a significant increase in sophisticated impersonation attacks targeting customers through phone calls and text messages — with displaced losses landing on banks under emerging reimbursement rules.</p>
            <a class="article-source" href="https://sqmagazine.co.uk/ai-voice-cloning-fraud-statistics/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Source · <strong>SQ Magazine</strong></a>
          </div>
        </li>

      </ol>

      <!-- SIDEBAR -->
      <aside class="sidebar">

        <div class="side-block">
          <div class="alert-card">
            <div class="label"><span class="dot"></span>Active threat</div>
            <h4>Voice-cloning scams targeting families.</h4>
            <p>Attackers are using seconds of public audio to impersonate sons, daughters and grandchildren in distress. Agree on a verification word with your family — now, not later.</p>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="side-block">
          <div class="side-head">Sujets tendance</div>
          <div class="topics">
            <a href="#feed" class="topic-tag" data-jump="alert">Alerts <span class="count">3</span></a>
            <a href="#feed" class="topic-tag" data-jump="regulation">Regulation <span class="count">2</span></a>
            <a href="#feed" class="topic-tag" data-jump="research">Research <span class="count">1</span></a>
            <a href="#feed" class="topic-tag" data-jump="regulation">Policy <span class="count">1</span></a>
